description "Insane Selkath

A Selkath driven to primal madness by the Progenitor's sonic wailing. Durable, frenzied, and lethal in close quarters.

^2Weaponry:
- Selkath Claws
-- Heavy Melee, Poisons On Hit
- Double Fira Vibroblades
-- No Blaster Defense, Saber Defense (1)
-- Low BP, Low Damage
- Progenitor's Call (Shotgun)  
-- Stuns on hit

^5Powers:
- Insanity (Rage 2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (3)
- Selkath Strength (1)
- Dash (1)
- Getups (4)
- Assemble (1)

^8Abilities:
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Insanity (Rage 2) ^3[CS1]
- Barge ^3[CS3]
- Personal Shield ^3[CS4]"